desc:
This is a FNaF: Ultimate Custom Night fangame where one person is picked to be the night guard, and the others? Well, they are all animatronics trying to get you! Survive until 6 AM, or repeat the endless cycle of death befitting of the man behind the slaughter.

- All characters featured in this game are the creations of Scott Cawthon, thanks to him for the wonderful franchise he has given us! 
- Type "!votekick (player account name)" in chat to vote to kick exploiters or abusive players. 
- Triggering a challenge night can only happen every 5 nights with 7 or more players. Badges and points cannot be obtained in private servers. 
- Private server owners can access the command panel at the top middle of the screen.
- Badge icons by @sway2mybeatincosmos

